@startuml IntegrationOtherDataSources
title Other Data Sources Integration Flow
participant MrTick
participant AddonLoader
participant CustomAdapter
participant ExternalAPI

MrTick -> AddonLoader: getRegisteredDataSource()
AddonLoader -> CustomAdapter: getAdapter()
CustomAdapter -> CustomAdapter: Implementa IDataSource

MrTick -> CustomAdapter: pull(checkpoint)
CustomAdapter -> ExternalAPI: GET /api/endpoint
ExternalAPI -> CustomAdapter: JSON / API Response
CustomAdapter -> CustomAdapter: Map ExternalFormat -> Task
CustomAdapter -> MrTick: tasks[], metadata[]

note over CustomAdapter
  Addons customizados via @mr-tick/sdk
  Conversao para modelo canonico
end note
@enduml
